<div class="views-element-container"><div class="view view-gps-constellation view-id-gps_constellation view-display-id-page_1 js-view-dom-id-69ff0d5a7f6a4699d9d07507459a0aca34c029037c463472dd920ce53d7c697c">
  
    
      <div class="view-header">
      <div class="container">
	<div class="row">
		<div class="col-lg-9">
			<p>The Global Positioning System Directorate has approved a change to the Navstar GPS Control Segment to User Support Community Interfaces (ICD-GPS-240 and ICD-GPS-870) which will remove GPS satellite plane/slot and clock information from the Operational Advisory message. This change proposal was approved by the GPS Interface Control Working Group in December of 2018. SVN/PRN, Block Type, and NANU details will continue to be included.</p>
		</div>
