                                                                                        <td class="views-field views-field-field-nanu-message-body">NOTICE ADVISORY TO NAVSTAR USERS (NANU) 2025067 NANU TYPE: GENERAL<br />
*** GENERAL MESSAGE TO ALL GPS USERS ***<br />
On 29 September 2025, GPS will transition SVN 51 (PRN 20) into the broadcast almanac for all satellites. The almanac transition, accomplished one satellite at a time, will require approximately 24 hours to complete. Before, during, and after transition SVN 51 (PRN 20) will remain unusable until further notice. Future NANUs will notify users of any changes to the above stated status. On approximately 30 September 2025, SVN 51 will resume transmitting L-band utilizing PRN 20.<br />
*** GENERAL MESSAGE TO ALL GPS USERS ***<br />
<br />
